From 7094baf6edf6797fd5c3f0b58ca668f9307b4906 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:15:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Port Backrooms native fixes onto the packaged skinning and
 memory-limit base

Port 6b4794f, 62f4af0 and e4d548d's native behavior, including the
672ada9 model-lookup prerequisite. Preserve every oversized hardware-skinning
protection and the unsupported-memory-limit no-op.

Cache genuine SW VTX misses with separate GAME/all-path scopes, retain alternate mounts for
malformed/zero-checksum files, bound the cache and reset it on map shutdown.
Read transforms lazily and restore nested pending/cached render state.
Validate PAS signature/data/memory bounds and restore only owned offsets on
disable or native-module close; keep the visibility switch off by default.

Add offline production-code harnesses for the cache, transform and PAS paths.
The existing skinning and memory-limit regressions also pass. No game run.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
